T*
(code, or ethics approval. If you need an extension, ask now - once, politely, with a date.) Tj
T*
(- Day 4-10. Substance week. Identification, measurement, sample, theory. Do the costly work) Tj
T*
(first. Language polish is cheap and should come last.) Tj
T*
(- Day 11-14. Tables, figures, appendices, robustness. Every new number must be reproducible) Tj
