(claim in the letter is literally true.) Tj
T*
(- Day 18-19. Blind read by a colleague who was not a co-author. Ask only two questions:) Tj
T*
('Where are we still defensive?' and 'Which comment did we under-answer?') Tj
T*
(- Day 20-21. Consistency pass: abstract, highlights, contribution paragraph, page numbers in) Tj
